      "content": "2. The tenant shall pay Rs 8,300/- (Rupees EIGHT THOUSAND THREE HUNDRED Only) to the owner, free of interest, which shall be refunded to the tenant within 30 days of the expiry of the Term after deducting arrears on rent, electricity, Gas, utility payments, maintenance, repair, water bills, etc, if any. The security deposit cannot be adjusted against the Rent in any case.",
